{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And Elohim said further to Moses: Thus shall you say to the children of Israel.</b> To the sages of the generation." "<b>YHWH, the Elohim of your fathers.</b> From the side of His distinctive activity, which the distinctive Name indicates, and from the side of His being the Elohim of your fathers, who made a covenant with them and with their seed." "<b>This is My name forever.</b> The distinctive Name — and this is the prior Name that indicates My precedence: My existence is preceded and eternal. It is My memorial to generation after generation — that is, what all the sages of the generations, new and old alike, grasped: that there necessarily exists a prior, eternal being, unchanging."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:13.689468342Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}